[B1] CHECK 约束实存（10 条新约束，5 表 ×2）：
  claims | ck_claims_tenant_xor | CHECK ((visibility='public' AND tenant_id IS NULL) OR (visibility='tenant' AND tenant_id IS NOT NULL))
  claims | ck_claims_visibility | CHECK (visibility IN ('public','tenant'))
  document_revisions | ck_document_revisions_tenant_xor | （同上 XOR 形态）
  document_revisions | ck_document_revisions_visibility | CHECK (visibility IN ('public','tenant'))
  documents | ck_documents_tenant_xor | （同上 XOR 形态）
  documents | ck_documents_visibility | CHECK (visibility IN ('public','tenant'))
  evidence | ck_evidence_tenant_xor | （同上 XOR 形态）
  evidence | ck_evidence_visibility | CHECK (visibility IN ('public','tenant'))
  sources | ck_sources_tenant_xor | （同上 XOR 形态）
  sources | ck_sources_visibility | CHECK (visibility IN ('public','tenant'))
  （另 evidence ck_span_not_inverted / text_blocks ck_block_span_not_inverted 区间不倒置）
[B2] 索引实存：
  ix_claims_subject_predicate_status | CREATE INDEX ... ON claims (subject, predicate, claim_status)
  uq_current_revision_per_document | CREATE UNIQUE INDEX ... ON document_revisions (document_id) WHERE is_current
[B3] 列实存：
  text_blocks: block_id, revision_id, ordinal, start_offset, end_offset, text_sha256, block_text
  evidence: ..., block_id, quote_sha256, verified_at（新增 3 列）
  document_revisions: revision_id, document_id, revision_number, content_hash, created_at, is_current, previous_revision_id, visibility, tenant_id（命名对齐生效）
